WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:02:00.155
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
02:00.425 --> 02:02.065
Didn't you say to come at 8:00 a.m.?

3
02:02.145 --> 02:03.425
Why are you so early?

4
02:04.225 --> 02:05.225
You're early too.

5
02:06.025 --> 02:07.065
By the way,

6
02:07.145 --> 02:09.105
I made a plan based on your schedule.

7
02:09.185 --> 02:10.185
It's here.

8
02:10.265 --> 02:12.265
We can proceed according to this.

9
02:15.545 --> 02:18.265
From Monday to Friday, I'm free at 10:00 p.m.

10
02:18.905 --> 02:20.345
You can rearrange it.

11
02:23.265 --> 02:25.305
Okay. I'll give it to you after I'm done.

12
02:30.225 --> 02:31.425
Don't worry.

13
02:31.505 --> 02:35.145
We can submit all competition materials before the end of the semester.

14
02:35.225 --> 02:36.385
It won't affect finals.

15
02:55.025 --> 02:58.185
When reviewing, take note of a few metabolic processes.

16
02:58.265 --> 03:01.985
Photosynthesis and nitrogen fixation won't be on the exam.

17
03:02.065 --> 03:04.865
Okay, prepare well for the final exam.

18
03:04.945 --> 03:06.305
Class dismissed.

19
03:09.625 --> 03:10.745
Wait, everyone.

20
03:10.825 --> 03:12.025
I have something to say.

21
03:12.105 --> 03:14.705
We've partnered with the Qingyi Nature Conservancy

22
03:14.785 --> 03:16.465
to organize a fundraiser.

23
03:16.545 --> 03:18.145
Here's the donation intent form.

24
03:18.225 --> 03:20.345
Let's do our part for nature.

25
03:21.145 --> 03:22.465
Check the box

26
03:22.545 --> 03:23.665
and sign.

27
03:24.265 --> 03:25.825
Donations will be collected…

28
03:25.905 --> 03:28.105
Zheng Yu, you haven't filled it out yet.

29
03:28.185 --> 03:30.145
Class monitor, can't you tell?

30
03:30.225 --> 03:32.065
There's no way she will donate.

31
03:32.145 --> 03:34.785
Really, it's the rest of us who should be donating to her!

32
03:46.665 --> 03:47.545
What?

33
03:47.625 --> 03:49.505
You said you should donate to me.

34
03:49.585 --> 03:51.185
Don't just talk.

35
03:53.945 --> 03:55.105
Crazy.

36
04:08.505 --> 04:09.545
Class monitor.

37
04:09.625 --> 04:11.185
I'll donate extra for Zheng Yu.

38
04:14.345 --> 04:15.265
Thank you.

39
04:15.865 --> 04:16.985
Help pass these out.

40
04:19.665 --> 04:20.745
You're so good to her.

41
04:20.825 --> 04:22.505
-Plus mine. -Mine too.

42
04:29.345 --> 04:32.625
DONATION FORM

43
04:33.785 --> 04:35.345
You wimped out.

44
04:35.425 --> 04:37.025
She's a crazy…

45
04:38.945 --> 04:40.025
Sorry.

46
04:43.225 --> 04:44.345
You just watch.

47
04:44.425 --> 04:46.465
I'll teach her a lesson sooner or later.

48
04:47.265 --> 04:48.385
What?

49
04:48.465 --> 04:51.185
For the final exam, you must skate five times.

50
04:51.785 --> 04:54.585
You must demonstrate all four moves that you've learned.

51
04:54.665 --> 04:57.105
The forward cross, the backward cross,

52
04:57.185 --> 04:59.305
the fish, and the snake.

53
04:59.385 --> 05:00.985
For the last move, it's freestyle.

54
05:01.065 --> 05:02.025
Is that clear?

55
05:02.105 --> 05:04.305
-Yes. -Yes.

56
05:04.385 --> 05:06.585
We'll use the same groups as before.

57
05:06.665 --> 05:07.825
First group, get ready.

58
05:37.585 --> 05:38.705
Next group.

59
05:40.265 --> 05:41.385
It's our turn.

60
05:41.905 --> 05:42.945
Let's go.

61
06:37.465 --> 06:38.305
All right.

62
06:38.825 --> 06:39.785
Get going.

63
06:40.465 --> 06:41.905
Let me see.

64
06:41.985 --> 06:43.065
So what's the score?

65
06:43.145 --> 06:44.345
Let me see.

66
06:44.425 --> 06:45.985
I want to see. I'm curious.

67
06:47.785 --> 06:48.625
How did you do?

68
06:48.705 --> 06:51.305
There's a crowd. We got told to leave.

69
06:52.185 --> 06:55.345
He says he will announce it with the overall results.

70
06:56.105 --> 06:56.985
You improved fast.

71
06:57.985 --> 06:58.945
Thanks for the tip.

72
06:59.025 --> 07:00.465
I shouldn't have told you.

73
07:00.545 --> 07:02.665
As expected of the number one, everything comes easy for you.

74
07:05.785 --> 07:07.305
Not that easily, actually.

75
07:07.385 --> 07:08.505
Look.

76
07:12.225 --> 07:14.065
I secretly put in the effort.

77
07:14.145 --> 07:15.105
Don't tell anyone.

78
07:19.465 --> 07:21.505
I've submitted the competition materials.

79
07:22.025 --> 07:22.905
Okay.

80
07:25.745 --> 07:28.545
I've been meaning to ask. Why do you work so hard?

81
07:29.425 --> 07:32.945
You come to the campus so early and leave so late.

82
07:33.025 --> 07:36.185
You spend weekends in the lab or the library.

83
07:36.265 --> 07:38.105
You don't seem to lack anything.

84
07:38.185 --> 07:39.945
Why choose such a difficult way?

85
07:40.825 --> 07:41.745
What do you think?

86
07:42.345 --> 07:45.585
Because you don't want to lose to your top scholar brother.

87
07:53.105 --> 07:55.785
I watched an interview video of Zhou Guanqi online.

88
07:55.865 --> 07:57.105
You happened to be in it.

89
07:59.105 --> 08:01.425
If I had such an incredible brother,

90
08:02.265 --> 08:04.065
I would be under a lot of pressure.

91
08:04.145 --> 08:05.145
Zheng Yu.

92
08:08.185 --> 08:11.345
Don't assume that a few conversations and a few meetings

93
08:11.425 --> 08:12.625
make us close friends.

94
08:13.545 --> 08:16.225
Don't you think that is a personal question?

95
08:17.145 --> 08:18.785
Only one person gets the award.

96
08:18.865 --> 08:21.345
Our rollerblade class grades are close.

97
08:21.425 --> 08:23.585
Rather than asking about these things,

98
08:24.185 --> 08:25.945
you're better off studying.

99
08:36.264 --> 08:38.024
Those bright moments

100
08:38.105 --> 08:40.024
always appear so indistinct.

101
08:41.505 --> 08:43.985
Only at the moment of being hurt

102
08:44.065 --> 08:46.585
does a relationship feel real.

103
08:49.465 --> 08:52.865
I have yet to understand that a person arrives

104
08:52.945 --> 08:55.345
with all their yesterdays behind them.

105
09:10.825 --> 09:14.025
LIYUAN BUILDING 9

106
09:26.065 --> 09:26.985
QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR

107
09:27.785 --> 09:28.825
ZHOU GUANQI INTERVIEW

108
09:30.505 --> 09:32.945
Right, there's also that post.

109
09:33.025 --> 09:35.825
DOES ANYONE KNOW WHAT QINGYI'S TOP SCHOLAR SIX YEARS AGO, ZHOU GUANQI, IS DOING NOW?

110
09:39.825 --> 09:43.065
Zhou Guanqi passed away long ago.

111
09:51.905 --> 09:53.265
How did he die?

112
10:27.665 --> 10:31.105
NANSHAN BOTANICAL GARDEN

113
11:00.945 --> 11:01.825
Hey.

114
11:01.905 --> 11:04.825
Ms. Zhou, when will you be here?

115
11:04.905 --> 11:07.745
Yanzhou has been waiting here for nearly an hour.

116
11:07.825 --> 11:09.625
I've been so busy that I forgot.

117
11:09.705 --> 11:11.225
Is Yanzhou next to you?

118
11:11.305 --> 11:12.745
Put him on the phone.

119
11:16.985 --> 11:18.185
It's Ms. Zhou.

120
11:19.545 --> 11:21.905
Yanzhou, the weather is terrible.

121
11:21.985 --> 11:24.385
The forecast predicts strong winds later.

122
11:24.465 --> 11:27.545
Will your school field trip be canceled?

123
11:27.625 --> 11:28.865
Are you still going?

124
11:28.945 --> 11:30.385
Why don't I call the school?

125
11:30.465 --> 11:32.185
-Let's not go. -All right.

126
11:32.785 --> 11:34.185
Okay, let's do that.

127
11:34.265 --> 11:35.625
Stay with your brother.

128
11:35.705 --> 11:38.385
But don't bother him. It's a critical period for him.

129
11:38.465 --> 11:39.785
Ms. Zhou, you…

130
11:46.025 --> 11:48.865
I already called a cab. It will be here soon.

131
11:51.305 --> 11:52.385
Yanzhou.

132
11:54.065 --> 11:55.305
I'll go with you.

133
12:34.745 --> 12:37.705
ZHOU GUANQI PASSED AWAY LONG AGO.

134
12:46.305 --> 12:48.345
CHEN YANZHOU

135
12:48.425 --> 12:50.985
Are you studying at home for the next few days?

136
13:04.345 --> 13:05.545
Don't lock it.

137
13:06.825 --> 13:09.305
Have you seen a kid's watch?

138
13:09.385 --> 13:11.865
Someone found it. It's in the box on the counter.

139
13:16.225 --> 13:17.345
Zheng Yu.

140
13:18.345 --> 13:19.185
What is it?

141
13:19.265 --> 13:21.945
Before locking up today, did you check the shelf items?

142
13:22.705 --> 13:23.945
I did.

143
13:24.505 --> 13:25.905
Here's a heads-up.

144
13:25.985 --> 13:27.145
I saw on the news today

145
13:27.225 --> 13:29.025
that someone is buying expired items

146
13:29.105 --> 13:31.465
when the salesclerks aren't paying attention.

147
13:31.545 --> 13:33.865
Then they file a complaint at the Industrial and Commercial Bureau.

148
13:33.945 --> 13:35.425
The fine is tenfold then.

149
13:36.265 --> 13:39.705
That will never happen at our store, right?

150
13:40.305 --> 13:41.305
Of course not.

151
14:02.985 --> 14:04.905
I'm so sleepy.

152
14:07.105 --> 14:08.105
How are you doing?

153
14:09.825 --> 14:11.505
I still have so much to memorize.

154
14:12.545 --> 14:15.465
Last-minute cramming is better than not cramming at all.

155
14:17.985 --> 14:19.185
Unlike the top students.

156
14:20.505 --> 14:22.145
They have their own challenges.

157
14:23.385 --> 14:25.025
I heard them say

158
14:25.105 --> 14:28.065
that the Vitality Award will likely go to Chen Yanzhou.

159
14:28.705 --> 14:31.585
Is that the guy who wouldn't even give me a bottle of water?

160
14:32.905 --> 14:34.345
Zheng Yu should win instead.

161
14:35.585 --> 14:36.665
Dropped the grudge?

162
15:13.425 --> 15:15.945
MICROBIOLOGY CLOSED-BOOK EXAM, 90 MINUTES ALLOTTED

163
15:47.105 --> 15:47.945
Finally.

164
15:48.505 --> 15:51.585
After the immunology exam, I can go home.

165
15:51.665 --> 15:54.385
EXAM SCHEDULE, IMMUNOLOGY

166
15:57.665 --> 15:59.425
RICE BALL

167
16:15.305 --> 16:17.785
YOUR TEAM ADVANCED TO THE EXCELLENCE CUP FINALS

168
17:36.425 --> 17:39.185
Fifteen minutes left until the exam is over.

169
17:39.265 --> 17:41.785
Students, please make use of your time.

170
17:41.865 --> 17:43.585
Double-check your class,

171
17:43.665 --> 17:45.425
name, and student ID number.

172
17:59.465 --> 18:00.305
Sir.

173
18:00.905 --> 18:02.265
Someone is cheating.

174
18:08.265 --> 18:09.105
It's not mine.

175
18:09.185 --> 18:10.785
Someone tossed it onto my desk.

176
18:12.745 --> 18:13.905
Who tossed it?

177
18:18.745 --> 18:20.385
Nobody is saying anything?

178
18:21.105 --> 18:22.705
Fine. Continue with the exam.

179
18:22.785 --> 18:25.025
I will report this and retrieve CCTV footage.

180
18:32.865 --> 18:33.705
What happened?

181
18:33.785 --> 18:35.105
Did he really cheat?

182
18:35.825 --> 18:37.785
He was caught red-handed but denied it.

183
18:38.545 --> 18:39.745
I can't believe it.

184
18:40.505 --> 18:42.865
I had finished already. I just…

185
18:42.945 --> 18:44.305
It was from the rear left.

186
18:44.385 --> 18:45.585
I'm not sure

187
18:45.665 --> 18:47.305
from how far away.

188
18:47.385 --> 18:48.225
Don't worry.

189
18:48.305 --> 18:49.505
We will find out.

190
19:02.065 --> 19:04.145
Give your parents my best.

191
19:04.225 --> 19:05.105
Okay.

192
19:05.185 --> 19:06.225
Bye.

193
19:08.985 --> 19:10.665
Zheng Yu, come.

194
19:14.265 --> 19:16.545
Here. This is yours, right?

195
19:17.985 --> 19:19.345
I cleaned the fridge today.

196
19:19.425 --> 19:20.985
I opened it and looked.

197
19:21.065 --> 19:22.705
Your rice balls are all expired.

198
19:22.785 --> 19:25.025
Eating those will give you an upset stomach.

199
19:25.785 --> 19:28.505
Throw them away. You haven't eaten them, have you?

200
19:30.385 --> 19:31.585
No.

201
19:31.665 --> 19:32.825
Thank goodness.

202
19:34.305 --> 19:35.265
Okay.

203
19:41.705 --> 19:44.985
CURRY CHICKEN RICE BALL

204
20:15.145 --> 20:19.825
I don't know when that grain of rice from the rice ball landed on my sleeve.

205
20:21.505 --> 20:23.665
It seemed to be reminding me

206
20:24.825 --> 20:26.905
that the harder you push through life,

207
20:26.985 --> 20:29.345
the more life assumes you can take on.

208
20:30.945 --> 20:33.545
I stretch everything to its limit.

209
20:33.625 --> 20:37.305
-Xiaozheng, why are you taking so long? -Meals.

210
20:37.385 --> 20:40.465
-Sleep. Energy. -Are you not feeling well?

211
20:41.785 --> 20:44.025
As a result, on the one day I couldn't afford to lose,

212
20:45.665 --> 20:46.945
I lost to myself.

213
20:47.705 --> 20:49.385
I'm going to the nursing station.

214
20:49.465 --> 20:51.705
I'll bring back food for you while I'm at it.

215
21:06.985 --> 21:08.945
HOUDE HALL

216
21:09.025 --> 21:10.905
Miss, you wanted to see me?

217
21:13.145 --> 21:14.505
Take this.

218
21:14.585 --> 21:16.585
Fill it out and return it.

219
21:16.665 --> 21:19.545
This is for verifying low-income students next semester.

220
21:19.625 --> 21:23.465
Make sure to write down any changes to your family and economic situation.

221
21:25.665 --> 21:27.185
Don't go yet. One more thing.

222
21:29.145 --> 21:32.105
This is the seating chart on the day of the immunology exam.

223
21:32.825 --> 21:34.865
You sat near Chen Yanzhou.

224
21:34.945 --> 21:37.305
The exam was almost over at the time.

225
21:37.385 --> 21:39.705
Did you see anyone toss the paper ball to him?

226
21:41.065 --> 21:41.905
I didn't notice.

227
21:43.185 --> 21:44.665
Then during the exam,

228
21:44.745 --> 21:46.865
did you notice anything unusual about him?

229
21:51.425 --> 21:52.665
No.

230
21:55.265 --> 21:56.825
Has it not been cleared up yet?

231
21:57.665 --> 21:59.345
One of the cameras was down.

232
21:59.425 --> 22:02.505
The other one didn't have anything useful.

233
22:02.585 --> 22:05.305
They were right in the blind spot.

234
22:05.385 --> 22:06.465
I asked every person.

235
22:06.545 --> 22:09.505
After questioning for days, we haven't gotten anywhere.

236
22:09.585 --> 22:11.665
FALL SEMESTER 2024 EXAM SEATING CHART

237
22:20.825 --> 22:22.025
What's going on?

238
22:22.105 --> 22:25.065
Didn't we agree not to release the immunology exam scores?

239
22:25.145 --> 22:27.665
Why are even the overall rankings out too?

240
22:27.745 --> 22:29.065
So much time has passed.

241
22:29.145 --> 22:31.345
Many students are asking for their grades.

242
22:32.105 --> 22:35.665
You question the validity of the scores, but you haven't filed a report.

243
22:35.745 --> 22:38.665
I'm merely releasing it according to procedure.

244
22:40.465 --> 22:41.985
You can go. I'm busy.

245
22:42.065 --> 22:44.265
If you recall something, tell me right away.

246
23:00.065 --> 23:01.425
The GPA rankings are out.

247
23:01.505 --> 23:03.065
His score wasn't invalidated.

248
23:03.145 --> 23:04.065
HE DENIED CHEATING

249
23:04.145 --> 23:06.665
Zheng Yu was supposed to be number one.

250
23:06.745 --> 23:08.265
What happened? What did I miss?

251
23:12.825 --> 23:14.665
Done with final exams?

252
23:14.745 --> 23:16.505
I'm waiting for you to send money.

253
23:22.425 --> 23:23.985
I would love for this to happen.

254
23:30.145 --> 23:31.625
Congratulations, Zheng Yu.

255
23:33.905 --> 23:37.025
Didn't you see the college's notice?

256
23:40.025 --> 23:42.465
The overall rankings were retracted.

257
23:42.545 --> 23:44.665
If Chen Yanzhou's cheating is confirmed,

258
23:44.745 --> 23:46.425
you will probably get the award.

259
23:52.145 --> 23:54.065
Why haven't you gone home yet?

260
23:55.265 --> 23:56.665
We got into the cup finals.

261
23:56.745 --> 24:00.185
I want to stay to revise my thesis before going home.

262
24:00.265 --> 24:02.945
The thesis defense is after the break. Time is tight.

263
24:04.105 --> 24:07.225
Many people in our major got in. Didn't you sign up?

264
24:18.905 --> 24:21.585
CHEN YANZHOU

265
24:21.665 --> 24:23.425
Did we get into the finals?

266
24:27.785 --> 24:28.705
Yes.

267
24:28.785 --> 24:30.465
I'm already refining the thesis.

268
24:31.585 --> 24:32.585
Where are you?

269
24:32.665 --> 24:34.265
I'll come find you now.

270
24:42.425 --> 24:44.465
Why didn't you tell me about the finals?

271
24:44.545 --> 24:47.905
I haven't seen you around. I thought you had left already.

272
24:48.505 --> 24:50.625
There's still some time until the finals.

273
24:50.705 --> 24:52.745
There isn't much to do. I can handle it.

274
24:54.985 --> 24:57.745
I searched online for information about Zhou Guanqi

275
24:57.825 --> 24:59.905
and presumed to know your mind.

276
25:00.825 --> 25:03.185
That was wrong of me. I apologize.

277
25:05.665 --> 25:07.385
But I've said this before.

278
25:07.465 --> 25:11.265
Since I chose to work with you, I won't take advantage of you.

279
25:12.025 --> 25:13.105
See you at the lab tomorrow.

280
25:14.265 --> 25:15.425
Are you sure

281
25:16.545 --> 25:17.825
you want to go together?

282
25:20.105 --> 25:21.305
Of course.

283
25:33.105 --> 25:34.185
This…

284
25:40.385 --> 25:42.545
Has his matter been sorted out?

285
25:42.625 --> 25:44.545
There's no concrete evidence.

286
25:44.625 --> 25:46.025
He hasn't been back long.

287
25:46.105 --> 25:47.145
He really is unlucky.

288
26:03.465 --> 26:05.185
When did they get so close?

289
26:05.265 --> 26:06.105
Who knows?

290
26:18.425 --> 26:19.545
Zheng Yu,

291
26:19.625 --> 26:23.025
so you and Chen Yanzhou teamed up for the Excellence Cup.

292
26:31.585 --> 26:35.305
Every year, there are a few students who get caught cheating.

293
26:36.105 --> 26:38.105
They usually have poor grades.

294
26:38.185 --> 26:40.865
It's the number one student who was caught this time.

295
26:40.945 --> 26:44.185
The number one's fall from grace is huge gossip for many people.

296
26:44.825 --> 26:47.425
Until proof of his innocence is provided,

297
26:48.345 --> 26:49.785
the gossip won't stop.

298
26:51.385 --> 26:52.265
What's your point?

299
26:52.345 --> 26:54.745
What I mean is,

300
26:54.825 --> 26:56.425
you and Chen Yanzhou are a team.

301
26:56.505 --> 26:58.145
You might get dragged into it.

302
26:58.945 --> 27:00.785
If his cheating is verified,

303
27:01.465 --> 27:02.985
it could affect your chances.

304
27:07.705 --> 27:08.705
I'm heading back.

305
27:24.145 --> 27:26.585
Did that cheat sheet have anything to do with you?

306
27:28.025 --> 27:29.345
We're a team.

307
27:29.945 --> 27:31.465
I want to hear the truth.

308
27:34.145 --> 27:37.345
I thought you came yesterday because you believed I didn't cheat,

309
27:37.425 --> 27:38.585
and we could carry on.

310
27:38.665 --> 27:40.505
I don't think you cheated.

311
27:40.585 --> 27:42.185
I just want to get things clear.

312
27:42.785 --> 27:44.505
I just need an answer from you.

313
27:45.105 --> 27:46.465
What answer?

314
27:47.225 --> 27:52.825
Since the first class exam, you've seemed nervous during every exam.

315
27:56.305 --> 27:59.065
So from your perspective, I'm mentally weak

316
27:59.145 --> 28:01.105
and need a cheat sheet for reassurance.

317
28:02.585 --> 28:03.785
Let's work separately.

318
28:04.385 --> 28:06.145
I'll do edits and supplementary experiments.

319
28:06.825 --> 28:08.145
You do the defense and slides.

320
28:08.905 --> 28:11.665
We contribute equally and don't bother each other.

321
28:35.705 --> 28:38.265
MR. LI

322
28:39.505 --> 28:40.345
Hello?

323
28:40.425 --> 28:41.945
I asked the university.

324
28:42.025 --> 28:45.385
Things are at a standstill, but there's no conclusive evidence.

325
28:45.465 --> 28:48.785
They won't hastily draw conclusions, so don't worry too much.

326
28:48.865 --> 28:50.305
I'm not worried.

327
28:50.385 --> 28:51.265
Good.

328
28:51.785 --> 28:53.705
The Excellence Cup is what matters.

329
28:54.745 --> 28:56.705
I'm leading the defense team this year.

330
28:56.785 --> 28:57.865
Are your slides done?

331
28:57.945 --> 28:59.825
You can show them to me first.

332
29:03.145 --> 29:05.425
Zheng Yu is doing them. You can ask her.

333
29:05.505 --> 29:07.585
What's wrong? Had a falling out?

334
29:08.345 --> 29:09.265
No.

335
29:14.345 --> 29:16.185
She asked me if I cheated,

336
29:16.265 --> 29:18.625
although I already knew that's just how she is.

337
29:19.505 --> 29:21.825
Last time, when she heard I gave you a red packet,

338
29:21.905 --> 29:24.025
she also came up to me and asked if it was true.

339
29:24.105 --> 29:26.545
How did she know about that?

340
29:26.625 --> 29:27.825
I don't know either.

341
29:27.905 --> 29:30.185
I think she heard it from someone.

342
29:32.025 --> 29:35.385
I didn't really mind at the time. That frankness was nice.

343
29:35.985 --> 29:37.265
But today,

344
29:37.345 --> 29:39.745
I felt like those words crossed the line.

345
29:40.625 --> 29:41.945
I get it.

346
29:42.025 --> 29:44.505
Back then, a stranger suspected you.

347
29:44.585 --> 29:46.865
Tonight, a friend doubted you.

348
29:46.945 --> 29:48.825
That would certainly feel different.

349
29:48.905 --> 29:51.785
Forget it. Enough talking. I have to revise my paper.

350
29:51.865 --> 29:53.065
Okay, carry on. Bye.

351
30:06.825 --> 30:07.945
…ADJUVANT STRATEGIES…

352
30:10.225 --> 30:11.305
ON CHEN YANZHOU

353
30:17.145 --> 30:18.545
ON CHEN YANZHOU

354
30:32.105 --> 30:33.945
Gosh, Linlin!

355
30:34.025 --> 30:35.345
Check the forum!

356
30:35.425 --> 30:37.065
A post got bumped up.

357
30:37.145 --> 30:40.865
Someone asked anonymously about a top scholar named Zhou Guanqi.

358
30:40.945 --> 30:42.545
Many people are discussing it.

359
30:42.625 --> 30:45.225
They say this guy is Chen Yanzhou's brother.

360
30:45.305 --> 30:46.545
It has over 100 comments.

361
30:47.145 --> 30:48.785
What's the title of the post?

362
30:48.865 --> 30:50.105
It's…

363
30:51.505 --> 30:52.825
Let me see.

364
30:54.145 --> 31:00.305
Does anyone know what Qingyi's top scholar six years ago, Zhou Guanqi, is doing now?

365
31:06.945 --> 31:09.865
I only know that Zhou Guanqi's brother is studying biology at Qing Yi University,

366
31:09.945 --> 31:11.385
same major as his brother.

367
31:11.465 --> 31:12.865
His name is Chen Yanzhou.

368
31:12.945 --> 31:15.185
We were in the same lab.

369
31:15.265 --> 31:17.785
They are brothers?

370
31:17.865 --> 31:20.265
How smart is Chen Yanzhou?

371
31:20.345 --> 31:22.385
I recently heard that he cheated on an exam.

372
31:23.185 --> 31:25.825
He has been back for so long and still hasn't returned to the lab.

373
31:25.905 --> 31:27.145
Judge for yourselves.

374
31:29.345 --> 31:32.745
Same university, same major.

375
31:32.825 --> 31:34.865
Why is he copying his brother?

376
31:35.945 --> 31:38.945
I was wondering how he got into CXL's lab as a freshman.

377
31:39.025 --> 31:42.065
Those who know, know how hard it is to get into CXL's lab.

378
31:42.145 --> 31:44.585
Did the university give him special treatment because of his brother?

379
31:44.665 --> 31:46.025
What happened to his brother?

380
31:46.105 --> 31:47.185
I found out.

381
31:47.265 --> 31:50.145
Six years ago, while staying on campus during the semester break,

382
31:50.225 --> 31:52.185
ZGQ got into a car accident.

383
31:52.265 --> 31:54.145
The university had to bear some responsibility.

384
31:54.225 --> 31:57.505
Besides, he was a top scholar who attracted much attention.

385
31:57.585 --> 31:58.785
Six years ago?

386
31:58.865 --> 32:00.305
He died when he was just a freshman?

387
32:00.385 --> 32:02.985
No wonder he wasn't punished for cheating.

388
32:03.065 --> 32:04.145
I'm in the same college.

389
32:04.225 --> 32:07.065
I've never heard about Zhou Guanqi's passing.

390
32:07.145 --> 32:08.625
The university kept it quiet.

391
32:08.705 --> 32:11.265
Students in later years hardly know anything about this.

392
32:21.865 --> 32:24.745
ARE YOU SURE YOU WANT TO DELETE THIS POST?

393
32:28.545 --> 32:30.905
THE POST HAS BEEN DELETED

394
32:52.185 --> 32:53.385
ON CHEN YANZHOU

395
33:54.945 --> 33:58.065
Why are you here? Didn't we agree to work separately?

396
34:01.945 --> 34:05.185
Didn't you say Mr. Li treats all students fairly?

397
34:05.265 --> 34:08.385
Even if I ask to borrow the key, I can get it.

398
34:08.465 --> 34:10.105
So why can't I be here?

399
34:14.065 --> 34:17.065
My laptop isn't working. I couldn't work on the slides.

400
34:17.145 --> 34:18.824
I came to use the computer.

401
34:27.585 --> 34:28.744
Did you not sleep?

402
34:30.865 --> 34:33.344
If you can't finish editing the paper, I can help.

403
34:33.945 --> 34:35.225
If you're worried,

404
34:35.304 --> 34:37.065
you can check it before submission.

405
34:41.784 --> 34:43.344
You can add this data

406
34:43.425 --> 34:45.585
from the supplementary experiments.

407
34:48.264 --> 34:50.744
I need to use the computer here for a few days.

408
34:50.824 --> 34:53.105
Will you leave the key in the usual spot?

409
34:53.705 --> 34:54.625
Not necessarily.

410
34:58.545 --> 35:01.745
WU FA: PLAYING DEAD?

411
35:25.265 --> 35:27.865
TABLE OF CONTENTS: 1: BACKGROUND, 2: METHODS, 3: RESULTS, 4: SUMMARY

412
36:00.025 --> 36:02.385
-Hello. -I was just about to call you.

413
36:02.465 --> 36:04.945
I have a classmate who works at a biotech company.

414
36:05.545 --> 36:08.225
They need a freelancer for document translations.

415
36:08.305 --> 36:10.665
-I'll add you to the group chat. -Okay.

416
36:10.745 --> 36:13.105
By the way, why were you calling me?

417
36:13.985 --> 36:16.545
Can you ask agencies you know

418
36:16.625 --> 36:18.385
if any tutoring positions are open?

419
36:18.465 --> 36:20.145
Preferably close to campus.

420
36:20.225 --> 36:22.665
Wasn't your tutoring gig going well?

421
36:23.505 --> 36:24.905
I heard the agent say

422
36:24.985 --> 36:27.825
the kid's final exam results improved significantly.

423
36:27.905 --> 36:30.865
Won't another gig be too much on your plate?

424
36:31.745 --> 36:34.345
I have to pay off a huge debt.

425
36:48.065 --> 36:49.265
Twenty-two yuan.

426
36:50.225 --> 36:52.545
About the perfume money…

427
36:53.425 --> 36:54.265
It's okay.

428
36:54.345 --> 36:57.145
If you don't have the cash, you can pay me next semester.

429
37:00.705 --> 37:02.225
It's the Lunar New Year soon.

430
37:02.305 --> 37:05.305
When I get my red packets, I can buy more perfume.

431
37:09.945 --> 37:11.065
Okay.

432
37:13.105 --> 37:15.465
Don't get me wrong. I'm not being nice.

433
37:16.305 --> 37:20.065
I know someone won the Vitality Award using dishonorable methods.

434
37:20.145 --> 37:21.625
You can't get the money yet.

435
37:26.185 --> 37:27.385
Bye.

436
37:44.385 --> 37:47.105
Go.

437
37:48.265 --> 37:49.705
Chen Yanzhou,

438
37:49.785 --> 37:51.825
I want to ask you something.

439
37:52.505 --> 37:54.065
What is it?

440
37:55.985 --> 37:57.465
I'm asking for a freshman.

441
37:58.065 --> 38:01.785
Doesn't Cheng Xiulin's lab rarely recruit freshmen?

442
38:01.865 --> 38:04.825
When you were a freshman, how did you get in?

443
38:04.905 --> 38:06.185
Share your experience.

444
38:06.785 --> 38:09.625
On the forum, it said that Zhou Guanqi was your brother.

445
38:10.625 --> 38:13.825
You had such a smart brother. Why haven't you mentioned him?

446
38:14.825 --> 38:17.025
Cheng Xiulin and Li Yanan both taught him.

447
38:17.105 --> 38:18.745
No wonder they treat you so well.

448
38:19.945 --> 38:21.705
The university even deleted the post for you.

449
38:22.945 --> 38:24.265
I really envy you.

450
38:27.505 --> 38:29.705
If your brain is fried, cool off over there.

451
38:38.705 --> 38:40.425
I told you I didn't want to go.

452
38:41.825 --> 38:43.385
I'm going to the restroom.

453
38:43.465 --> 38:44.905
ZHANG XINRAN, CHEN YANZHOU…

454
38:52.825 --> 38:56.625
Zheng Yu, we're going out to eat later. Will you join us?

455
38:57.785 --> 38:59.305
I came late. I'm not done yet.

456
39:01.425 --> 39:02.425
ZHENG YU

457
39:02.505 --> 39:03.905
CHEN YANZHOU

458
39:04.505 --> 39:07.145
Do you believe Chen Yanzhou didn't cheat?

459
39:12.065 --> 39:13.905
I just think you were right.

460
39:13.985 --> 39:15.945
The two of us are competing in a team.

461
39:16.545 --> 39:19.025
Proving his innocence will be for the best.

462
39:26.145 --> 39:27.825
RECENT CALLS

463
39:27.905 --> 39:28.865
ZHENG YU

464
39:54.025 --> 39:55.785
Let's put these together.

465
39:58.385 --> 40:01.985
Zheng Yu, how come you weren't at the lab this morning?

466
40:02.065 --> 40:02.905
I had a gig.

467
40:14.425 --> 40:15.905
ON CHEN YANZHOU

468
40:25.025 --> 40:27.825
Did Chen Yanzhou go to the lab today?

469
40:27.905 --> 40:30.305
Yes. He sat in front of me.

470
40:37.945 --> 40:40.505
Can you lend me the key to the old lab?

471
40:40.585 --> 40:42.025
My laptop isn't fixed yet.

472
40:45.945 --> 40:47.825
CHEN YANZHOU

473
41:03.745 --> 41:05.745
Didn't you swear you would ignore her?

474
41:06.425 --> 41:08.225
She broke the ice first.

475
41:08.905 --> 41:10.025
When did she do that?

476
41:10.625 --> 41:13.345
It was that forum post. She asked for gossip.

477
41:16.585 --> 41:17.865
Let's continue.

478
41:37.985 --> 41:39.665
-What is it? -Is Chen Yanzhou here?

479
41:41.025 --> 41:43.425
No. If that's all, I'm closing the door.

480
41:43.505 --> 41:45.985
If the smell gets out, we'll get scolded again.

481
42:03.025 --> 42:04.945
CHEN YANZHOU

482
42:32.705 --> 42:34.105
OLD

483
43:24.825 --> 43:27.065
Can you lend me the key to the old lab?

484
43:27.145 --> 43:28.785
My laptop isn't fixed yet.

485
43:57.825 --> 43:58.945
WU FA

486
44:07.545 --> 44:10.025
JUST NOW

487
44:20.785 --> 44:21.785
Hello?

488
44:21.865 --> 44:24.185
You finally picked up.

489
44:24.265 --> 44:26.945
Where's this semester's 30,000 yuan?

490
44:27.025 --> 44:31.225
Did you not get that lousy award money this time?

491
44:32.025 --> 44:34.425
There were special circumstances this time.

492
44:34.505 --> 44:36.705
We had an agreement.

493
44:36.785 --> 44:39.545
You pay 30,000 yuan at the end of every semester,

494
44:39.625 --> 44:42.385
and we won't show up in your life.

495
44:42.465 --> 44:46.145
If even one bit of it is missing, don't blame us for breaking the agreement.

496
44:46.225 --> 44:49.465
We've found the hospital where your mother is.

497
44:49.545 --> 44:51.105
It's only a matter of time

498
44:51.185 --> 44:54.705
before we locate her ward as well as where you're studying.

499
44:56.145 --> 44:57.785
Don't worry.

500
44:57.865 --> 45:00.945
You will get the full 30,000 yuan.

501
45:01.025 --> 45:02.465
So where's the money now?

502
45:03.505 --> 45:04.665
Say something.

503
45:05.505 --> 45:06.465
Talk!

504
45:07.265 --> 45:08.505
This time,

505
45:09.385 --> 45:11.825
someone cheated and ranked number one.

506
45:13.425 --> 45:14.785
So it has been delayed.

507
45:14.865 --> 45:16.225
The university is handling it.

508
45:16.825 --> 45:19.305
When it's over, they will send me the money.

509
45:20.145 --> 45:22.345
You had better not be lying.

510
45:22.425 --> 45:25.705
Otherwise, you know the consequences.

511
45:40.185 --> 45:41.425
This time,

512
45:42.305 --> 45:45.425
someone cheated and ranked number one.

513
45:46.345 --> 45:47.785
So it has been delayed.

514
45:51.345 --> 45:53.905
ON THE IMMUNE-ENHANCING EFFECT OF PARTICULATE…

515
45:53.985 --> 45:55.145
ZHENG YU

516
45:55.225 --> 45:57.185
Are you going to the defense?

517
46:00.945 --> 46:02.065
No.

518
46:04.585 --> 46:07.065
What about the networking event in two days?

519
46:07.145 --> 46:09.225
Past winners will share their experience.

520
46:11.105 --> 46:12.345
No.

521
46:18.265 --> 46:19.345
Okay.

522
46:41.065 --> 46:42.545
Did you just leave?

523
46:43.465 --> 46:45.465
It's so late. Why are you still here?

524
46:45.545 --> 46:48.345
I just finished coaching a few competing teams.

525
46:49.145 --> 46:52.385
By the way, Zheng Yu sent me the slides for your defense.

526
46:52.465 --> 46:55.305
I've already told her what to revise.

527
46:55.385 --> 46:56.745
Did she send them to you?

528
46:58.785 --> 47:00.785
Are you two still upset with each other?

529
47:03.305 --> 47:06.265
When two people have a common goal and work together,

530
47:06.345 --> 47:07.985
the illusion of mutual connection develops.

531
47:08.585 --> 47:10.425
When a conflict of interest arises,

532
47:10.505 --> 47:12.185
that illusion quickly shatters.

533
47:12.785 --> 47:16.305
Resolve this yourselves. Don't let it affect the competition, okay?

534
47:16.985 --> 47:19.745
Are you going to the networking event in two days?

535
47:20.625 --> 47:22.625
My mom will do waste sorting outreach.

536
47:22.705 --> 47:25.265
-I'm helping out. -Sorting waste won't take all day.

537
47:25.345 --> 47:26.425
Come by after that.

538
47:27.905 --> 47:29.145
Waste sorting outreach.

539
47:31.065 --> 47:32.825
Waste sorting, right…

540
47:48.425 --> 47:49.865
LEFU YAYUAN

541
48:30.145 --> 48:32.665
I'm just saying hi. No need to overreact.

542
48:33.265 --> 48:36.385
Do you think your way of "saying hi" is polite?

543
48:36.905 --> 48:39.185
Sorry, I was too impatient.

544
48:40.865 --> 48:41.865
What do you want?

545
48:43.225 --> 48:45.625
I heard at the networking event

546
48:45.705 --> 48:48.145
that the project you and Chen Yanzhou are doing is going well.

547
48:48.745 --> 48:50.385
The teachers and judges like it.

548
48:50.465 --> 48:51.785
It seems

549
48:52.465 --> 48:53.465
you two get along.

550
48:54.945 --> 48:57.025
Don't concern yourself with our matters.

551
48:58.185 --> 49:00.025
That's not what I'm concerned about.

552
49:00.625 --> 49:01.865
It's your future.

553
49:01.945 --> 49:03.745
You had better pray

554
49:03.825 --> 49:06.025
that you don't win the Excellence Cup.

555
49:06.105 --> 49:08.985
Chen Yanzhou was just rumored to have cheated.

556
49:09.585 --> 49:11.905
Do you think everyone will stand for it?

557
49:11.985 --> 49:12.905
It's 20,000 yuan.

558
49:12.985 --> 49:15.625
It's a lot of money. Many people will be envious.

559
49:15.705 --> 49:19.105
As his partner, be careful of getting caught in the crosshairs.

560
49:20.345 --> 49:21.465
Don't worry about it.

561
49:22.545 --> 49:23.385
Zheng Yu.

562
49:26.905 --> 49:31.265
You must want to know what happened during the immunology exam.
